# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated model files. Both notebooks re-create these in a few seconds from the
# PET-MAD-XS checkpoint, so there is no reason to track them.
#
# The checkpoint itself is not in this repository at all: it lives at
# /home/unito/pet-mad-models/pet-mad-xs-v1.6.0.ckpt on the classroom machine, and
# carries no LLPR uncertainty wrapper, so the notebooks export it directly and no
# second copy is ever written to disk. Keep it that way -- checkpoints are large
# binaries and GitHub rejects anything above 100 MB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.lammpstrj

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working backups (e.g. water-md.backup-20260819-110916/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.backup-*/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Written next to the notebook by the ethanol fine-tuning run. The train/val/test
# splits are not listed: they are held in memory only, and the copies metatrain
# needs go to a temporary directory. finetuned.ckpt is covered by *.ckpt above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ethanol-finetune/outputs/
ethanol-finetune/extensions/
ethanol-finetune/trajs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Written next to the notebook by the live LAMMPS runs. Everything those runs
# read -- inputs, starting structures, precomputed trajectories and thermo logs,
# figures -- is outside this repository, under /home/unito/ on the classroom
# machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
water-md/water_thermo.out
water-md/water_traj.lammpstrj
water-md/nacl_thermo.out
water-md/nacl_traj.lammpstrj
water-md/ethanol_thermo.out
water-md/ethanol_traj.lammpstrj
water-md/log.lammps

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded material
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
deprecated/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# jupyter / python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
